     "body": "<p>PR-30 has been merged.</p>\n\n<p>The other ontologies in this GitHub repository could also benefit from similar styling. Would you be interested in doing that in this ticket or would you prefer putting it in the backlog as a new ticket?</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/blob/master/audit.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/blob/master/audit.rdf</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/blob/master/indexing.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/blob/master/indexing.rdf</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/blob/master/oai-pmh.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/ontology/blob/master/oai-pmh.rdf</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
